//
// TV-1 PREFLIGHT RECORD (charge § Mandatory preflight)
//   1 Repository / remote ....... dwats250/strategy — PASS
//   2 Branch .................... claude/pr2-post-merge-integrity-o5rrto
//   3 Starting SHA .............. d17ca53dd0f0796d72ec2abbc518c9bf1bf9d55e
//   4 Clean working tree ........ PASS
