// TV-2 to resolve against the pinned source. None is called exact.
//   DI-1  S-02 REVERSAL: EMA9/21 spread denominator taken as EMA21.
//   DI-2  S-03/S-04: TREND / PULLBACK / degraded-to-CHOP band definition.
//   DI-3  D-02 true-range definition and first-bar seed.
